    <item rdf:about="https://resolutionbazaar.com/doku.php?id=rbz_services:ibc_agents:ibc_asset_valuation&amp;rev=1743536806&amp;do=diff">
        <dc:format>text/html</dc:format>
        <dc:date>2025-04-01T19:46:46+00:00</dc:date>
        <dc:creator>admin (admin@undisclosed.example.com)</dc:creator>
        <title>ibc_asset_valuation</title>
        <link>https://resolutionbazaar.com/doku.php?id=rbz_services:ibc_agents:ibc_asset_valuation&amp;rev=1743536806&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Use Cases

	*   Real-Time Property Valuation - AI agents in real estate collect property information and evaluate it in real-time to find the property’s actual costs. AI agents consider vast amounts of data like the condition of the property, amenities, historical prices, appraisals, location, market demand, and much more, and evaluate them to provide accurate valuations instantly. This way, AI agents save time for real estate agents and help them make better decisions regarding the costs of the…</description>
    </item>
